WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
AI agents fail. Can we predict failure before it happens?

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Twenty thousand synthetic agent runs, with sixteen telemetry signals.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
Train on telemetry, validate thresholds, and test on separate cohorts.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
The logistic baseline achieves point seven six five ROC A U C on synthetic test data.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
Score failure risk locally, with no prompt and no API key.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Agent Pulse. Open research by Zubair Hussain. Build, test, and contribute.

